## 11. Print Even Numbers from 1 to 100

An even number is completely divisible by 2.

Condition: `i % 2 == 0`

```cpp
#include <iostream>
using namespace std;

int main() {

    for(int i = 1; i <= 100; i++) {

        if(i % 2 == 0) {
            cout << i << endl;
        }

    }

    return 0;
}
```

**Output:**
```text
2
4
6
8
10
...
100
```

