## 12. Print Odd Numbers Divisible by 3 from 1 to 100

An odd number is not completely divisible by 2.

A number divisible by 3 has remainder zero when divided by 3.

**Conditions:**
- `i % 2 != 0`
- `i % 3 == 0`

Both conditions must be true.

```cpp
#include <iostream>
using namespace std;

int main() {

    for(int i = 1; i <= 100; i++) {

        if(i % 2 != 0 && i % 3 == 0) {
            cout << i << endl;
        }

    }

    return 0;
}
```

**Output:**
```text
3
9
15
21
27
33
39
45
51
57
63
69
75
81
87
93
99
```
